{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791839580, "covers_from": "2026-10-12T21:13:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-12T21:14:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791839640, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-12T21:13:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 32544, "sprite_key": "beaver_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "城市公寓外觀太醜。建築太老舊外，電䌫亂七八糟，大樓冷氣架鐵窗等破壞外觀，豪無美感，實在可惜。", "display_name": "中山代表 Ettie 莊愛娥", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-12T21:13:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 53668, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "走在台北街道,經常會聞到從排水孔蓋飄出的臭味, 這告訴我們鼠患,淹水的來源,也是首都之恥。", "display_name": "大安代表 No.53,668", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-12T21:13:29+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 44420, "sprite_key": "bear_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "經濟", "content": "目前經濟不景氣，是否能調整薪資結構？", "display_name": "信義代表 No.44,420", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-12T21:13:35+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 20281, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "環境", "content": "號稱首都的台北市四處看起來都是老舊的，加速都更，修繕老屋，是要神速進行的。", "display_name": "北投代表 No.20,281", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-12T21:13:47+00:00", "duration_seconds": 13, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 44762, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "交通", "content": "易肇事的小路口應該新增紅綠燈，而不是放著不管！", "display_name": "北投代表 石少年", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 53668, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.53,668", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 44420, "sprite_key": "bear_business", "display_name": "信義代表 No.44,420", "district": "xinyi", "is_replay": true, "frozen